```mermaid
flowchart TB
    src[Source emits RawEvent] -->|captured| redact[Source-side redaction]
    redact -->|redacted?| filter{kit/policy CEL}
    filter -->|veto| drop1([dropped — filtered])
    filter -->|allow| dedup{Fingerprint match<br/>recent event?}
    dedup -->|yes| drop2([dropped — deduped])
    dedup -->|no| compress[Compressor<br/>burst → one event]
    compress --> session[Tag SessionID<br/>from cutter]
    session --> buf[(Append to buffer)]
    buf --> queue[Enqueue ring]
    queue --> net{dpkms reachable?}
    net -->|no| wait[Hold in buffer<br/>emit .waiting]
    wait -. retry-after .-> net
    net -->|yes| post[POST /api/v1/analyze]
    post --> resp{2xx?}
    resp -->|yes| ok([succeeded])
    resp -->|no| fail([failed — retry per backoff])
```
